  "hash": 2041432007,
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Scoring multiple Kills with the weapon spawns a Dark Ether Charge at the target's location. ? second cooldown between Charge spawns.\n\nCharge spawning progress on Kill by <link Enemy Rank [#CombatantClassifications] />:\nMinors and Players: 25% | Elites: ?% | Minibosses and higher: 100%\n\nDark Ether Charges last 5? seconds and can be detonated by shooting or coming into contact with them.\n\nDetonations deal up to <pve 386 /> <pvp [50] /> elemental damage in a 3? meter radius and match the weapon's element. Detonations inherit the weapon's <link Combatant Damage Scaling [#CombatantScaling] />.\n\nDamage is always attributed to the Charge's creator regardless of who destroys them.\n\nDetonating Charges <title refills [G_refill] /> and overfills the magazines of all equipped Dark Eather Reaper weapons from reserves up to 140% capacity (rounded up).",
      "updatedAt": "2024-11-07T19:07:15.217Z",
      "updatedBy": "Stardust"
    }
  },
  "associated": [],
  "compendium": {
    "gid": "1662574278",
    "rowKey": "Dark Ether Reaper\n\nEpisode: Revenant",
    "section": "Origin Traits",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Upon reaching 100% Counter Progress by scoring Weapon Kills:\nRank-And-File = 25% ↑35% | Elite+ = 100% | Guardians = 25% ↑35%\nCounter persists through stow.\n\n Spawns an Element-Matching Dark Ether Charge that floats in the air for 4 seconds before expiring.\nDark Ether Charges can be detonated by either shooting at them or coming into contact with them.\nDark Ether Charges deal up to 386 [50] Element-Matching Weapon Damage over 3? meters. \nDamage against Combatants scales with Combatant Rank Modifiers. Kills with Dark Ether Charges progress the counter.\nDark Ether Charge damage counts as Weapon Damage. Damage is always attributed to the creator, regardless of who destroys the Dark Ether Charge.\n \nUpon interacting with a Dark Ether Charge:\nRefills the Magazine.\nGrants 40% Increased Magazine Capacity of all equipped Dark Ether Reaper Weapons.\nMagazine increases are rounded up.\n\nDark Ether Charge Progress is paused if a Dark Ether Charge has spawned.",
